  "project_description": "This module adds a new general \"Link with description\" field that allow editor to enter a long description along with link title and url.\n\n The link title and url inherit their functionality and behaviour from the Drupal core Link module and same field formatters are available.\n\n Both formatted fields are fully themable.\n\n This is a good alternative to creating a custom paragraphs entity when a link field need to have a description text along with the link title.",
